  "job_B1.5.8_20251001_193249": {
    "text": "Men \u00f0a leofostan, we synd gemyngode \u00feurh \u00f0yses d\u00e6ges wur\u00f0mynt, \u00fee we wur\u00f0ia\u00f0 to lofe \u00fe\u00e6re eadigan\nAc we nella\u00f0 secgan be \u00fe\u00e6re gesetnysse of \u00f0am gedwylde, \u00fee gedwolmen setton be hyre acennednysse,\nIoachim w\u00e6s gehaten hyre halga f\u00e6der and Anna hyre modor, under Moyses lage \u00e6lice lybbende on\nHim geu\u00f0e \u00fea god, \u00fee ealle \u00f0ing gediht, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6t bearn begeaton, \u00fee ab\u00e6r urne h\u00e6lend, Marian \u00fea\nAnd heo wear\u00f0 acenned, \u00fe\u00e6t heo com to mannum on \u00f0ysum andweardan d\u00e6ge ures drihtnes modor on\nAnd eac his godcundnyss w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6re menniscnysse to anum so\u00f0an Criste of hyre acenned, \u00e6fre\nNu is \u00f0es d\u00e6g gehalgod hyre to wur\u00f0mynte on eallum cristendome for hyre acennednysse, swa swa heo\nAnd we on halgum lofsangum hyre m\u00e6r\u00f0a cy\u00f0a\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t heo us \u00feingige to hyre agenum suna, \u00fe\u00e6t he us\nO\u00f0ra halgena tid and heora freolsdagas we habba\u00f0 on gemynde mid urum lofsangum on \u00f0am dagum, \u00fee\nAc we ne healda\u00f0 nateshwon nanes halgan acennednysse on urum gemynde, hu hi to mannum comon,\nHeora gebyrdtida beo\u00f0 on bocum gesette for \u00f0am micclum m\u00e6r\u00f0um mancynnes alysednysse.\nNu wylle we eow secgan sum \u00f0ing eow to lare for \u00f0ises d\u00e6ges m\u00e6r\u00f0e, \u00fee eow mage to trymminge, gif\nIncipit De Sancta Virginitate.\nSe halga h\u00e6lend Crist and se heofenlica \u00e6\u00feeling of his \u00e6lmihtigan f\u00e6der w\u00e6s \u00e6fre acenned butan\nAnd he is se eca wisdom of \u00feam wisan f\u00e6der, \u00feurh \u00feone he gesceop ealle gesceafta, ge \u00f0a\nSe ylca h\u00e6lend sy\u00f0\u00f0an on \u00fe\u00e6re syxtan ylde \u00feyssere worulde wear\u00f0 to men geboren of Marian \u00feam\nHe gebohte eall mancynn mid his agenum life, for\u00fean \u00f0e we w\u00e6ron forwyrhte to helle.\nAc us alysde se h\u00e6lend mid his halgum blode of \u00feam ecan \u00feeowte \u00fe\u00e6s ealdan deofles.\nHe geceas \u00fea him sylfum, swa swa us secga\u00f0 bec, \u00fea halgan gela\u00f0unge him sylfum to bryde, \u00fe\u00e6t is eall\nBe \u00feam sang se sealmwyrhta \u00feisum wordum secgende: In sole posuit tabernaculum suum, et cetera, He\nIohannes, se fulluhtere, be \u00feam ylcan cw\u00e6\u00fe: Qui habet sponsam, sponsus est, Se \u00f0e h\u00e6f\u00f0 bryde, he is se\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re halgan bec, \u00fee hatte Apocalipsis, is oft geswutelod, \u00fe\u00e6t se so\u00f0a h\u00e6lend is se gastlica\n\u00d0urh \u00feone halgan geleafan heo is him beweddod ure ealra modor, and heo is m\u00e6den swa \u00feeah, \u00e6fre\nHeo is an culfre gecweden on bocum for \u00f0\u00e6re bylewitnysse \u00fe\u00e6s beorhtan geleafan, \u00fee \u00f0a Cristenan\nAnd heo is cwen gehaten swa swa Cristes agen bryd.\nBe \u00feam sang se witega \u00feisum wordum cwe\u00f0ende: Adstitit regina a dextris tuis, et cetera, Seo cwen\n\u00de\u00e6t synd \u00fea godan weorc, \u00e6nlice embscryd eall mid fahnyssum, \u00fe\u00e6t syndon hyre mihta and\nAnd ealle godes cyrcan synd to anre getealde, and seo is seo gela\u00f0ung, \u00fee we embe spreca\u00f0.\nSeo asent hyre cild to \u00feam so\u00f0an life of \u00feyssere earfo\u00f0nysse, \u00fee we on wunia\u00f0, of \u00feisum sceortan life\nNu syndon ealle cristene men anum naman gehatene, ge weras, ge wif and \u00f0a unwittigan cild, seo\nAnd heo is m\u00e6den gehaten for \u00feam micclan geleafan and for \u00feam so\u00f0an truwan, \u00fee heo symle h\u00e6f\u00f0 to\n\u00deeah \u00f0e sume habbon \u00e6fter godes gesetnysse woruldlicne sinscipe, wunigende \u00e6tg\u00e6dere for bearnes\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 Paulus eac to eallum geleaffullum: Desponsavi vos uni viro, virginem castan exhibere\nHer ge gehyra\u00f0, hu he het eall folc, \u00fe\u00e6t is seo gela\u00f0ung, \u00f0e on god gelyf\u00f0, an cl\u00e6ne m\u00e6den, Cristes\nAnd se apostol beweddode witodlice \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den \u00feam h\u00e6lende Criste \u00feurh \u00f0one halgan geleafan, \u00fea\nAnd we synd gewissode \u00feurh his gewritu git, for\u00f0an \u00f0e his lar becom to eallum lareowum, and he is\nNu syndon \u00f0a men swi\u00f0e wur\u00f0fulle, \u00f0e on m\u00e6g\u00f0hade wunia\u00f0 sylfwilles for gode, \u00fee healda\u00f0 on\nAnd heo swa geefenl\u00e6c\u00f0 hire weres meder, \u00fee wunede on m\u00e6g\u00f0hade and Crist \u00feeah geb\u00e6r on hyre\nSwa is eac seo gela\u00f0ung \u00feurh geleafan m\u00e6den and on gastlicere cenninge acen\u00f0 d\u00e6ghwamlice\nMaria acende Crist lichamlice, ure ealra heafod, and seo halige gela\u00f0ung acen\u00f0 gastlice Cristes limu\nOn \u00e6g\u00ferum is m\u00e6g\u00f0had and eac swylce bearnteam, and se bearnteam ne wanode, ne ne awyrde \u00feone\nSeo gela\u00f0ung is halig on lichaman and on gaste, ac heo nis na eall m\u00e6den swa \u00feeah on lichaman, ac\nOn Cristes bec is awriten, \u00fe\u00e6t his modor com him to and his siblingas.\n\u00dea s\u00e6de him man \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00f0\u00e6r ute stodon and in ne mihton to him for \u00fe\u00e6re micclan menigu, \u00fee\nAc he andwyrde sona \u00feam secgendum \u00feus: La, hwa is min modor o\u00f0\u00f0e hwa synd mine gebro\u00f0ru?\nHe astrehte \u00fea his hand ofer his apostolas, \u00f0us him secgende: Her synd mine gebro\u00f0ru and eac min\nEadig is Maria, \u00fe\u00e6t heo his modor is, ac heo is eadigere \u00feurh his geleafan, \u00fe\u00e6t heo on hine gelyf\u00f0,\nHeo behet gode hyre m\u00e6g\u00f0had \u00e6t fruman, \u00fe\u00e6t heo lybban wolde hyre lif on m\u00e6g\u00f0hade sylfwilles for\nGod sende hyre \u00f0a to Gabrihel his heahengel, \u00fe\u00e6t he hyre cydde Cristes acennednysse \u00feurh hyre\nAnd heo mid \u00feysum wordum witodlice cydde, \u00fe\u00e6t heo h\u00e6fde behaten hyre m\u00e6g\u00f0had gode.\nGod mihte hi hatan, \u00fe\u00e6t heo heolde hyre m\u00e6g\u00fehad to swilcere acennednysse, ac w\u00e6s swa \u00feeah hyre\nNe magon o\u00f0re m\u00e6denu on heora mode ceorian, hwi hi moddru n\u00e6ron and eac swylce m\u00e6denu,\nAnd se ylca is ealra m\u00e6dena wur\u00f0mynt, \u00fee hine lufia\u00f0 gehealdenre cl\u00e6nnysse, and hi magon beon\nEall Cristes gela\u00f0ung is Cristes modor, for\u00f0an \u00f0e heo acen\u00f0 Cristes sylfes limu \u00feurh \u00f0a halgan gife on\nAnd Maria is his modor lichamlice and gastlice his swustor and so\u00f0lice his modor.\nAnd heo is ana for \u00f0i modor and m\u00e6den, modor lichamlice and modor gastlice, lichamlice heo ana\nSe m\u00e6g\u00f0had is gem\u00e6ne \u00e6g\u00ferum, cnihtum and m\u00e6denum, \u00fee cl\u00e6nlice lybba\u00f0 \u00e6fre fram cildhade o\u00f0\nSe m\u00e6g\u00f0had sceal \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6s modes godnysse gode beon geoffrod be his agenum cyre, \u00fe\u00e6t seo lac beo\nNe magon na ealle men beon anes modes, ne anre geearnunge \u00e6tforan \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan, swa swa\nAc se \u00f0e \u00e6ne beh\u00e6t \u00feam h\u00e6lende his cl\u00e6nnysse and \u00f0\u00e6t sy\u00f0\u00fean aw\u00e6g\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 scyldig wi\u00f0 god \u00fe\u00e6s\nGif gehadod m\u00e6den hi sylfe forlig\u00f0, heo m\u00e6g to gode gecyrran mid so\u00f0re d\u00e6dbote, ac heo ne wyr\u00f0\n\u00d0a \u00f0e on sinscipe wunia\u00f0 and embe \u00fe\u00e6t hogia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hi heora bearnteam gebringon to Criste \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd \u00f0a bearn sceolon beon gode gehyrsume to \u00fean \u00f0e heora magas hi gemynton and beheton.\nSume men wylla\u00f0 wolice bet\u00e6can heora la\u00f0ostan cild to godes lareowdome.\nAc hi ne geefenl\u00e6ca\u00f0 na Abrahame \u00feam heahf\u00e6dere, \u00fee his leofran sunu to lace geoffrode gode\nGode man sceal don mid gl\u00e6dnysse \u00e6fre \u00fea betstan behat, swa swa se witega bebead, Malachias\nEall swa be m\u00e6ssereafe, \u00fee sume menn macia\u00f0 of heora ealdum cla\u00f0um, \u00fee beo\u00f0 eal on swate, \u00feonne\nGif hwa wyle wyrcan weofodsceatas gode o\u00f0\u00f0e o\u00f0re reaf of his ealdum cla\u00f0um, gesylle \u00fea ealdan and\nMicel geoffra\u00f0 gode, \u00fee hine sylfne geoffra\u00f0.\n\u00de\u00e6t synd \u00f0a m\u00e6stan lac, \u00fee man m\u00e6g geoffrian, \u00fe\u00e6t he holocaustum beo, \u00fe\u00e6t is eall godes lac, swa\nHi beo\u00f0 Cristes martyras \u00feurh \u00f0a munuclican drohtnunge, na \u00e6ne gemartirode, ac oft digollice, swa\n\u00dea \u00f0e on sinscipe beo\u00f0 and on asettum timan hi to gode gebidda\u00f0, swa swa se apostol bebead, hi\nNu cwe\u00fea\u00f0 sume men, hwi god gescyppan wylle of \u00feam dyrnum forligrum \u00e6nig lybbende cild, \u00feonne\nIc acsige \u00feone man nu anes \u00feinges: Gif hwa forstel\u00f0 hw\u00e6te and \u00fe\u00e6t forstolene s\u00e6w\u00f0, hw\u00e6t ah \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd \u00e6lc sawul bi\u00f0 gesceapen \u00feurh god and \u00e6lces mannes lichama, \u00fee on life bi\u00f0 cucu, and se \u00f0e elles\nNu ne sceolon \u00fea m\u00e6denu heora moddru forseon, of \u00f0am \u00f0e hi comon, \u00feeah \u00f0e hi cl\u00e6ne beon on\nSeo w\u00e6s untymende o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t hundnigonteo\u00fee gear, and god him \u00fea behet, \u00fe\u00e6t hi habban sceoldon\nAnd se w\u00e6s gebletsod \u00feurh \u00feone so\u00f0an god swi\u00f0e ges\u00e6liglice.\nEft Isaaces wif, Rebecca gehaten, w\u00e6s untymende twentig wintra mid hyre gebeddan.\n\u00dea b\u00e6d Isaac \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan god, \u00fe\u00e6t he him bearn forgeafe.\nAnd his wif sy\u00f0\u00f0an wear\u00f0 mid getwysan, Esau and Iacob, and heo geswac \u00f0a teames.\nHit w\u00e6s wundorlic \u00f0ing, \u00fe\u00e6t god wolde behatan \u00feurh \u00feone Isaac us eallum bletsunge and \u00f0urh his\nAnd his wif swa \u00f0eah w\u00e6s swa untymende, o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t Isaac ab\u00e6d hyre bearnteames.\nOn \u00feam geswutelode god, \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon biddan his mildheortnysse \u00e6fre to his agenum bebodum,\nEall swa Iacobes wif, Rachel geciged, twentig wintra wunode mid hyre were fullice, \u00e6r\u00f0an \u00f0e heo cild\nHelchana se ealda and Anna his wif w\u00e6ron butan cilde, o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t heo ab\u00e6d \u00e6t gode mid agotenum\nEac on \u00fe\u00e6re niwan \u00e6 on anginne godspelles Zacharias leofode lange mid his wife, Elisabeth genamod,\nAc hi gestryndon on ylde, swa swa se engel him cydde, Iohannem \u00feone fulluhtere, \u00fee gefullode \u00feone\nSe w\u00e6s swa haliges lifes, \u00fe\u00e6t se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00fe be him, \u00fe\u00e6t of wifa bearnum n\u00e6s nan m\u00e6rra man.\nSynd swa \u00feeah \u00fea wudewan, \u00f0e wunia\u00f0 on cl\u00e6nnysse, to nunnan gehadode for \u00f0\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes lufon, on\nAnd \u00f0a m\u00e6denu beo\u00f0 on maran ge\u00feing\u00f0e, \u00fee synd gehadode to haligre drohtnunge, \u00feonne \u00fea\nHi sceolon swa \u00f0eah, swa swa we s\u00e6don \u00e6r, habban eadmodnysse on heora \u00e6\u00f0elum \u00feeawum mid\nGod hata\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00fea upahafenan mod, and his gast wuna\u00f0, swa swa god sylf s\u00e6de, ofer \u00f0one eadmodan\nBetere bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wif, \u00fee wuna\u00f0 on sinscipe, gode a gehyrsum to his halgum bebodum and eadmod on\nBetere bi\u00f0 to h\u00e6bbenne on haligre \u00feeawf\u00e6stnysse huru \u00f0a l\u00e6ssan god mid o\u00f0rum l\u00e6ssum godum,\nSwa is eac on lichaman se l\u00e6ssa man betere, swa swa Zacheus w\u00e6s, mid gesundfulnysse, \u00feonne se\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t l\u00e6sse god nahwar gelytlod \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t mare god on \u00feam m\u00e6g\u00f0hade, ne seo mare ne sceal\nAc mid godes ege beo \u00e6g\u00feer under\u00feeodd \u00fe\u00e6re boclican lare, and h\u00e6bbe heora \u00e6g\u00feer be heora\nNe sceolon \u00f0a cl\u00e6nan men, \u00fee Criste \u00feeowia\u00f0, edleanes gewilnian on \u00f0issere worulde, for\u00f0an \u00f0e God\nAc \u00f0es miccla wur\u00f0mynt nis na ealra manna, ac swa swa God s\u00e6de toforan sunum and dohtrum on\nSum synful wif iu, swa swa 